Scenario: View resynced partner workers
	Partner workers who are resynced to Zendesk should be in their appropriate organization with their appropriate tags.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Assigned Team Nested Field | ${staticAssignedTeamNestedField} | |
	| Code                       | OSBZENOSBZEN                     | |
	| Language                   | English                          | |
	| Name                       | Osbzen - ${staticProjectName}    | |
	| Region                     | United States                    | |
