	And the user with the email address "osb.partner2@lrpartner.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should have the name "OSB Partner2 [P]"
	When I remove a user with the email address "osb.partner1@lrpartner.com.broken" from an organization with the name "Osbzen - ${staticProjectName}"
	And I remove a user with the email address "osb.partner2@lrpartner.com.broken" from an organization with the name "Osbzen - ${staticProjectName}"
	And I remove all tags from the user with the email address "osb.partner1@lrpartner.com.broken"
	And I remove all tags from the user with the email address "osb.partner2@lrpartner.com.broken"
	And I wait for "10" seconds
	And I get all test passwords and admin emails
	And I log into the support homepage as "${staticSupportAdminEmailAdress}" with password "${staticSupportAdminPassword}"
	And I go to the OSB admin main page
	And I sync the project with the code "OSBZENOSBZEN" to zendesk
